<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="c85bc418ffa94a7e95ff5b50b9024292">说明：风险标签（infocode）</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="97078d96054247a688787bff402f36b5" />
<h1 nodeId="9a4ca9d90e0641c1a0f24319777827d7">一、背景</h1>
<p nodeId="016e9aa1e4064725b792d6e17aa55468">业务发展到一定程度，能够提炼出有限类的标签，来组合表征一个规则的业务含义。需要在执行后，能给下游传递这部分信息，以对风控结果做进一步有精细化运营的诉求。这类信息就被定义为infocode，以多级标签的形态管理，并绑定在规则上。标签本身具有优先级等属性，可供下游对信息做进一步加工。</p>
<p nodeId="4b02ee9cdbfb4e67a354e9dab3894bdf">过去，zeus已有自身的标签体系，因此在infocode上线后，原标签体系定位为【管理类标签】，而infocode定位为【风险标签】。都在菜单-策略管理-标签中进行维护。</p>
<km-collapse active="false" nodeId="f61ce407b615460d95edfb8bd7cc95a6">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>

</km-content>
</km-collapse>
<h1 nodeId="4ed9ab0570f84fb9a7858e6dba93718d">二、名词解释</h1>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="bd33d5a1262d4e298a1456d3ddb48203">
<tr nodeId="5d4da78f05474eba9e920b2d758d1dab">
<th colwidth="[96]" nodeId="074b6c474b9b4ec1a894dcb454005666">
<p nodeId="001533e5178f44cb9d8e55bcf9cd20e8">名词</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[759]" nodeId="28587ca90bb14ed79e48a9a86a793f77">
<p nodeId="4b72ce520aee417e8d3597076b9e13aa">解释</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="13230b664e6c4a8a9753d610fdd30aea">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="acd5eada508f4b9c991eb7d8cf07910c">
<p nodeId="6471a61f2dae48a5b4ad45f16583fa86">管理类标签</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[759]" nodeId="b02d44fbdafe44f382b6608380965cf0">
<p align="start" nodeId="ae523a3d071f4a00b10912af1ab64cb9">管理类标签用于在平台管理规则、因子、场景、特征、参数等实体。<a href="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1357692026" title="https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1357692026" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="d2dbed42eecb43e0b7ba078dfda483e6">https://km.sankuai.com/collabpage/1357692026</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="11a45655b1c4487c9d1d193c2cd7d5dd">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="12b069d10b164969a8fd94e7b8025062">
<p nodeId="f681b93dd48044638c39d83bfc327aae">风险标签</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[759]" nodeId="9b3135eb42e541a7b8879f5c84e0585c">
<p nodeId="1fc2ea50fa274946bec3fcb84968e61b">风险标签仅能与规则绑定，有优先级属性，用于将规则本身携带的信息归类成体系。规则在命中后，会将这部分信息实时输出给调用方/下游。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="9b9e425ee2c04fa78c86b0d9e336ee02">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="7d06def7391f458e8377d26e533a5966">
<p nodeId="632cb802b3bd43eb820b51df4b659bc7">父标签</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[759]" nodeId="c8f709b8029a44bb93582364306aba45">
<p nodeId="d4a978807c624e60a9143708d5fb3dfb">当前标签归属的上一级标签即为当前标签的父标签。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="a8f7ee9e933548eca353a9641d322f85">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="834d60bef6164e46af17d6015e4022bb">
<p nodeId="e8dc748e19f84375b9fb0e3b0462a7fc">标签层级</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[759]" nodeId="cd611ba1a9444f5a8342b71ac7b49932">
<p nodeId="fb76adfffe584829bde8a9eddf5854ec">目前 风险标签 支持最多形成6级关系。即用户可创建的最高标签层级为1级 ，最低为6级</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="7487d55121874e0fb259e807fb523e2a">
<td colwidth="[96]" nodeId="d84db835e8d8464fa271cd10c48748c3">
<p nodeId="6a9c80d34a8a46beb162a229c4297dd3">根标签</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[759]" nodeId="54d9c234d1724130b528dc458ecb6edb">
<p nodeId="824b0c34371c4a70bb0114b2cc29f3b5">系统内置的0级标签，默认作为所有1级标签的父标签。</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p nodeId="cbf7861dbc0e4414bef739c725e06635" />
<h1 nodeId="e06fa14b7f6b411fbd27b13acf1ee71b">三、操作指南</h1>
