<tr nodeId="fe3a217d7334426aa1b1e8d00543bd71">
<td colwidth="[126]" nodeId="efd445f3beb541a49a4f5fbc0c2fabd2">
<p nodeId="b1f748ae46e4451195a1d787ef4850bb">添加风险标签</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="8e8480d77292453090cbed51d225891b">
<p nodeId="66e5068e44de4228a1f31037c18e50fe">点击【添加标签】，在风险标签tab下，标签类型已经默认选择风险标签。</p>
<p nodeId="e34bd8e7ff4041bbb19e37e30e819196">输入自定义的标签名称，注意：名称不得与其他标签重复。</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[528]" nodeId="e443c2371f75412eb55331e47d251674">
<p nodeId="d36e5d592d0941f38218b2adc9b8adf2"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4133232192?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="960.87" height="600" nodeId="a640fe5e751246ca855529e89936c0a6" /></p>
<p nodeId="152829d9cb904f6f99243271f713fc16"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4133012727?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="959.84" height="600" nodeId="9a96c7d267ce403fb7c0dae4e105ea4d" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="3802824f172d417b8274d910fa7b6a5e">
<td colwidth="[126]" nodeId="73508eb0ae974192a40560474b73b1de">
<p nodeId="4d7bf172c7e64ee1a8341749af939015">编辑标签内容</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="89dca811558e451d9614b31cf045d685">
<p nodeId="b958df0fef0b47a79bab480ed21a4273">允许编辑</p>
<p nodeId="4fbb674819d74412abc143d738944d6a">名称：不允许重复</p>
<p nodeId="6b79844735a94dde806cad89bf8a407f">父标签：可选择别的父标签，即会使该标签从属到另一父标签下。</p>
<p nodeId="636f8ff1daa243469fb5e7e582861cf3">标签优先级：允许更改</p>
<p nodeId="560f131828cb476da62d452625f9bcc7">标签编码：允许更改</p>
<p nodeId="155ca873584d4c6a89ca94e40a06f237" />
<p nodeId="5764dba5e959437ab23393d4ab5a8b7c">删除：有依赖（已给规则打标过）的标签无法删除。</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[528]" nodeId="d977d01d88404b8b8f64a7d268864022">
<p nodeId="7f4edaf659f148828250bee5931346b2"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4133222246?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="882.37" height="600" nodeId="0e686008e91d4fb68b0090778802a39f" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="6d509dd4fb794eaca6a2e41a586593cf">
<td colwidth="[126]" nodeId="de00927fb95449a7b2256f39611fbe72">
<p nodeId="d1580dd4529d444b8b3ba9f48c4a3ffa">标签优先级重复提示</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="e8251d76c917465f8a4b4542f98230f7">
<p nodeId="9e662705dd3c4eceba83d78ce724ec00">若本次新增/编辑 提交的标签与已有标签的<span color="#FF4A47">优先级重复</span>，会弹窗提示用户此信息，并提供批量修改优先级的入口。</p>
<p nodeId="89b8239c1012435896b31ebebe1019d6">（此时标签已经成功创建，平台允许同优先级标签存在）</p>
<p nodeId="4faf17c57f7f49b7a6703758668ca8c4">批量修改优先级入口也可以通过右上角【批量操作-批量修改优先级】 进入</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[528]" nodeId="9fbe01c4483d41a989ff17d58bc54fcb">
<p nodeId="d71f46494bb8409d8d48fe01eb0bc934"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4131619657?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="963.36" height="600" nodeId="f8c7d86c0b7c4949979c4fa7d09e00b2" /></p>
<p nodeId="e398c0e54de14fbd83e26944fd706a37"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4148240856?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1425" height="303.44" nodeId="b4306d71ce564283aaf8566bc33cb1bd" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="50b8fe76c400490c8351a572a9be5bad">
<td colwidth="[126]" nodeId="0abe7e3d03a24b90870ad142a8372e06">
<p nodeId="90c144cb0aee42bc9cb9bc7a075b8bfd">批量修改优先级</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="1d5f3f3081c94c9b803763d9e18190e7">
<p nodeId="2ac70c61fb2648599091b5310606e5e3">对象类型（only风险标签，其他标签没有优先级）</p>
<p nodeId="3df7b106c5a741459f05bbd39e46e972">对象筛选：根据一系列搜索条件定位到需要批量修改优先级的项目。</p>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="252976125c464461bb46bb0511438bfb">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="7aba0b634014447f8c8573f670a06291">例：如本次添了一个优先级为500的标签，和原有某标签优先级重复，希望将原来大于500的优先级全部都+1，就可以搜索优先级范围500～999；也可根据标签id、名称、层级等进行搜索。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="f203a8d65b2e4acd947cfb5aa71b85b7">在下方列表中，<span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">勾选最终需要修改的项目。确认表后方【修改为】字段的内容。点击提交，将会把勾选的项目进行批量提交修改。</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[528]" nodeId="67fae25a68924f438a717020f53188bd">
<p nodeId="b7eaea15e86841a1b633a28a1bfe34a4"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4131637060?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1129.47" height="600" nodeId="4d8328ef77a0462794bf1024b24a0f8f" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2 nodeId="93861a8c3921405fa5c592ac59d49dfc">3.2 给规则打标</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="5e6c311a3e7e43468010a8b7ba794e76">
<tr nodeId="91d7a429ebc34487aa67ce66e3ec3c05">
<th colwidth="[102]" nodeId="e42fe543847e4687aef888208266e526">
<p nodeId="18572f40204248baa964ccd497bf69a8">模块</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[516]" nodeId="2ba7262041b84958a9536974341940a6">
<p nodeId="0e7a32feb89f4894a6c96fadf68f1224">说明</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[528]" nodeId="5b6ce58936e245febdfa2254b3eb8e71">
<p nodeId="3e6cf866bfe34c95941676a3318e07a9">图例</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="5c83d3b819504872a8012b9a2bccc8bf">
<td colwidth="[102]" nodeId="9fc731d2655a447f8257110f5a471a91">
<p nodeId="93e452248cec4d50a8f4066462609720">规则-编辑-属性信息</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="a9bd2b6bc233498882dc884a4389ce69">
<p nodeId="79dbee29ac9e4280bc6c3841b7b3d466">在规则编辑的第三步【属性信息】，可以为规则打上风险标签。</p>
<p nodeId="d325a593c6b14708a9050f6a494452a1">点击【+新标签】，可在下拉框中，按照层级选择希望添加的标签。</p>
<km-note type="tip" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="c3fe93e3433243248d34493cf4911c92">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="eccd6654b53e4c478eb7719ecc69baec"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)">注意：同规则仅允许赋予一条标签链路上的唯一标签。如有三层标签A1-A2-A3，不能同时给该规则同时赋予A2和A3。</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="a5b5babeb2cc47a3b48aeb79f0b8099b">规则详情中，显示标签内容的格式为【……-父父标签-父标签-<span color="#FF4A47">当前标签</span>】</p>
<p nodeId="298f0edd07534c2188c22d62d67b99e0">点击【完成】，成功将标签打给该规则。</p>
<p nodeId="ade7961096924f3abb962b60e75439c5" />
<p nodeId="3e4b597630e04d9ca04996158470b046">若需要按照<span color="#FF4A47">规则组</span>或其他条件<span color="#FF4A47">批量</span>给规则打上相同的标签，见3.3</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[528]" nodeId="0abfe955496f48568ff136a4fe72cf50">
<p nodeId="a83a1b818e5840d2a74700c4e4958e64"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4148071347?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="965.57" height="600" nodeId="d18efa499f7e4de29f07378e44d3a6a6" /></p>
<p nodeId="a5dbbb160e9c4fc99dcf083adf103318"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4146917115?contentType=1" name="image.jpeg" width="924" height="600" nodeId="f4cfc8914dc0496aa7db05d6f99e3a80" /></p>
<p nodeId="9d19cf7981354445ba2beab50ef5f79e"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4147546310?contentType=1" name="image.jpeg" width="1425" height="282" nodeId="ae4c738a88ca4d2f8678ac37f8d9b32b" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="d74345c622ac46a29834dd379e997e77">
<td colwidth="[102]" nodeId="eab709d96cb54e4599d491f999a11bdf">
<p nodeId="ac645835d3744f7ea924777a5af71da6">规则列表页</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="de55ffba356c43e28b8f1917657a0f40">
<p nodeId="4aa21433aef240c3949ec3143c29fc42">在规则列表页，也可以根据标签搜索规则。</p>
<p nodeId="ed0e1b00ee334557a01773d73d22ca43">列表页中，考虑到展示效果，标签显示内容中 <span color="#FF4A47">不包含父标签信息</span>。</p>
<p nodeId="c604023ae09e4697b2185b21f071fbeb" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[528]" nodeId="21918a142d634287bcd4117177f773b1">
<p nodeId="b480ea45336348af8f79a7876e491314"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4144958094?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1425" height="521.77" nodeId="694724525f2d4c408ea74daa2e4382d1" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2 nodeId="d1df5a9d655b4df9a35239090e4571f3">3.3 批量删除与批量打标</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="a1d3ca55987e4100a267c579e64c154b">
<tr nodeId="bda825209fa24d1eb1a4aee654fcdb5d">
<th colwidth="[93]" nodeId="a8a9921508a04f2ea72c2a3fab86fb16">
<p nodeId="79ae04b838374e4999e075bece520466">模块</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[516]" nodeId="5c2a8cf9a2ea4efc8c6451bc39d0393a">
<p nodeId="77b299b29f12452cadf3175191accb26">说明</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[528]" nodeId="c4c86cf929304dc0bbf3c2cbdccd7c6a">
<p nodeId="08d81602ae104b93a9feebb32a27024d">图例</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="ab9b5790519f43ed87199cce7d76f7b9">
<td colwidth="[93]" nodeId="6e485bba965c443dbfd3e111ab3cef29">
<p nodeId="7f9b32b6d5284be7b93fffa7a54132b3">批量删除</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="e7b6513247c84d0e82071be99cb99f68">
<p nodeId="70fc4f6a4d2746d09bf75e4ec2b5842f"><strong>功能描述</strong>：搜索定位<span color="#FF4A47">一批</span>具有<span color="#FF4A47">一个共同标签</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">的对象（规则、因子、场景……）</span>，从这批对象中<span color="#FF4A47">删除掉</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">对该标签的</span><span color="#FF4A47">引用关系</span>。</p>
<p nodeId="6167d34fa680470bba51185d310d2bb1"><strong>1.搜索要删除的对象标签</strong></p>
<p nodeId="c5ffbeeb062944fa835cfb0e4107496c">对象类型：选择要删除标签的对象<span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">（规则、因子、场景……）</span></p>
<p nodeId="50d5177c24c94daba646c7dbccfb39ae"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">当选择规则时，需要进一步选择是【风险标签】还是【管理类标签】</span></p>
<p nodeId="0548ad44ce3544f39ca68a3ce44d1a41"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">如需要，也可以加上规则组维度进一步缩小范围。（组合搜索的逻辑：指定规则组中具有该标签的规则）</span></p>
<p nodeId="3d3ac475aba749cfb8c7ed24230b8257"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><strong>2.配置标签</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="b4d080fec9e543e1b43c341129767d86"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">下方配置标签list中，可以勾选最终需要确认删除的标签。</span></p>
<p nodeId="99c3edf0eedc4c2d86342a5f763de302"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><strong>3.确认删除</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="2ecd31d0b03a4b518a23ac7fde1e9e08"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">最后点击【确认删除】，将会把该标签从对象中删去引用关系。</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[528]" nodeId="b5b2967df92c4312a22e76f2e0cddbba">
<p nodeId="e933374b92a74c148342c9a2050810f1"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4148199666?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1425" height="489.34" nodeId="a288ce6dcd9f4cd78de6f3a13e581b22" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="9b0e389d6d6b4ff58c179617c02240bd">
<td colwidth="[93]" nodeId="4020fd00654a40a99172eb5cf2ef9e92">
<p nodeId="29d09d19ea854b629d9d98f13f91c274">批量打标</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[516]" nodeId="a61825045e86497cbca42cf74b04d2d5">
<p nodeId="b830802a00ac497589cdfe19e643ea4e"><strong>功能描述</strong>：搜索定位<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">一批</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">对象（规则、因子、场景……）</span>，并选择一个期望配置的标签，给这批对象批量<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">加上</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">对该标签的</span><span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">引用关系</span>。</p>
<p nodeId="dd31e3b76a1b449d8e3dc3bd5d9fa2c5"><strong>1.搜索要打标的对象</strong></p>
<p nodeId="6dc21e58ac7244bfac9bbc2a026197d8">对象类型：选择要打标签的对象<span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">（规则、因子、场景……）</span></p>
<p nodeId="92cbc900c834444784ad3c37ea322ae9"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">当选择规则时，可以进一步选择用【风险标签】还是【管理类标签】来搜索。如需要也可以加上规则组维度进一步缩小范围（组合搜索的逻辑：指定规则组中 具有 该标签的规则）也可以只用规则组1个条件进行对象搜索</span></p>
<p nodeId="7791b4891f144d11bb35fe3ad36034b3"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">点击【查询】下方配置标签List会根据搜索条件展示所有搜到的对象。</span></p>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="38fd881b617548099272527a82c4e414">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="2357d5d6731c4d76acff82e800ed0e51">也可以选择<span color="#FF4A47">按文件</span>查询对象，准备txt文件，英文逗号隔开所有对象id。上传后，点击确认导入即可在下方list出现对象。示例：</p>
<km-attachment src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4159183855?contentType=0" name="a.txt" size="28B" nodeId="e9a45fe5cff94471833c287acff1754a" />
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="cbe119593f514eb6850aed37527a50f4"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><strong>2.批量配置标签</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="f5fe617b1f954dc8809e2b20edbb9f26"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">需要在此处选择，想要给这批对象打上什么标签。（对象为规则时，还需要选择打管理类还是风险标签）如图中，选择“zq测试2级”后，下方List中所有对象将要打上的标签都变为“zq测试2级”。</span></p>
<p nodeId="d228db6522d341a5960347149f058433"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><strong>3.配置标签</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="8ae73941d5194ac6adbf0358e9149fd3"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">此时可以针对其中具体的某条对象进行微调，下拉选择别的标签。</span></p>
<p nodeId="3c5acd6c456a431aa6f3f6dcc3e97767"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><strong>4.确认打标</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="c361a9b3964d45c78fa03ac5a2b43b55"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">勾选最终需要确认打标的项目。</span></p>
<p nodeId="bec7158d9e6a44d680de69b80ca06f38"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)">最后点击【确认打标】，将给勾选项目，打上所配置的标签。</span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[528]" nodeId="1a5250f777b741ffbfb383d5054f234b">
<p nodeId="64a185f561574b5f8ad6a7ca071ab09e"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4148968762?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="952.96" height="600" nodeId="6b9a64c579ad4240ac0c94cf513587c3" /></p>
<p nodeId="6e80271954f640c1a5ae55f86f9a3a1a"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1357166907/4152626710?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="1116.87" height="600" nodeId="63a03c8eb99b40838909cf3a0619158b" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
