<p nodeId="8596ff20337345b7ae164f8d610a1daa">配置了风险标签，也给规则打了标，但是实时返回结果里没有。</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[745]" nodeId="94563933623b47b5ac140d903d4542dc">
<p nodeId="fa3ee0b477d441d19c5293c4461f2892">请先确认本业务是否通过Tatooine请求zeus，若是，需要联系PM<km-mention name="周强" uid="zhouqiang23" empId="" nodeId="069749e11c0349c1acca758b373ed82c" />和RD<km-mention name="方小远" uid="fangxiaoyuan" empId="" nodeId="7abb47ae3f094952bfa0a3c1c26b5d36" />提需求，将在Tatooine对返回结果做加工，方可使用。</p>
</td>
</tr>
